@startuml
title Flujo de Comunicación Serial (Draeger Medibus)

participant "Python Receiver (Master / Client)" as Master
participant "Atlan Device (Slave / Server)" as Slave

== Inicialización de Comunicación ==
Master -> Slave: Command: ICC (0x51) [ESC + 0x51 + Checksum + CR]
Slave --> Master: Response: ICC [SOH + 0x51 + Checksum + CR]

Master -> Slave: Command: ReqDeviceId (0x52) [ESC + 0x52 + Checksum + CR]
Slave --> Master: Response: Device ID [SOH + 0x52 + Payload + Checksum + CR]

== Bucle de Consultas Periódicas (Cada 2s) ==
group Consulta de Datos
    Master -> Slave: Command: ReqMeasuredDataCP1 (0x24)
    Slave --> Master: Response: Measured Data (HR, SpO2, RR, PAW, etc.)
    note left: Registra en datos_atlan.txt
    
    Master -> Slave: Command: ReqDeviceSetting (0x29)
    Slave --> Master: Response: Settings Data
    note left: Registra en datos_atlan.txt
    
    Master -> Slave: Command: ReqAlarmsCP1 (0x27)
    Slave --> Master: Response: Active Alarms list
    note left: Registra en datos_atlan.txt
end
@enduml
